{"id":"fcd5f6f173ab82ca","group":"28","path":"28/28-prop-finite-reachability-bound.md","title":"有限配置图中的简单路径长度界","display":"prop-finite-reachability-bound — 有限配置图中的简单路径长度界","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-prop-finite-reachability-bound","aliases":["28-prop-finite-reachability-bound"],"display":"prop-finite-reachability-bound — 有限配置图中的简单路径长度界","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §4.1.1 Claim 4.4 and PATH discussion","source_printed_pages":"80–82","source_pdf_pages":"106–108","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-prop-finite-reachability-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-prop-finite-reachability-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-finite-reachability-bound — 有限配置图中的简单路径长度界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §4.1.1 Claim 4.4 and PATH discussion"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"80–82"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"106–108"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\">\\(G=(V,E)\\)</span> 是有限有向图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=|V|\\ge1\">\\(N=|V|\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in V\">\\(s,t\\in V\\)</span>。下式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^{m+1}\">\\(V^{m+1}\\)</span> 为长度m+1的顶点序列集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 包括0。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\left[\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_m)\\in V^{m+1}\\;\\left(v_0=s\\land v_m=t\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E\\right)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_m)\\in V^{m+1}\\;\\left[v_0=s\\land v_m=t\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(i&lt;j\\Rightarrow v_i\\ne v_j)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\left[\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_m)\\in V^{m+1}\\;\\left(v_0=s\\land v_m=t\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E\\right)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_m)\\in V^{m+1}\\;\\left[v_0=s\\land v_m=t\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(i&lt;j\\Rightarrow v_i\\ne v_j)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在所有s到t的路径长度中取最小值。若某顶点重复，删去两个出现位置间的闭游走可缩短路径，矛盾。因此至多N个顶点、N−1条边；s=t时长度0的路径已经满足结论。这也是配置可达性可以加有限时钟的原因。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§4.1.1 Claim 4.4 and PATH discussion；印刷 pp.80–82 / PDF pp.106–108。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"N=|V|\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"V^{m+1}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\left[\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_m)\\in V^{m+1}\\;\\left(v_0=s\\land v_m=t\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E\\right)\\right]\\\\\n&\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_m)\\in V^{m+1}\\;\\left[v_0=s\\land v_m=t\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\;(i<j\\Rightarrow v_i\\ne v_j)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1819,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-289","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-conl]]、[[28-prop-nl-contained-p]]、[[28-cor-l-strict-pspace]]、[[28-df-savitch-reachability]]、[[28-prop-finite-reachability-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}